Patch 1: patch┃Patch 2: patch
      1       ┃      2
━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━

Patch mode: comparisons use
only the source lines quoted
in the patches.

═════════════════════════════
*    DELTA DIFFERENCES      *
═════════════════════════════
Signs mark edits made by only
that patch. A sign-less line
with one number is an edit
both patches make: a new
number means both add it, an
old number means both remove
it.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
 old new│f.c  ┃ old new│f.c
        │@@   ┃        │@@
   1   1│alpha┃   1   1│alpha
        │─────╂────────┼─────
        │@@   ┃        │@@
        │     ┃   3   3│rx2
        │     ┃   4   4│rx3
       2│tx   ┃       5│tx
        │     ┃+      6│extra
+      3│     ┃   5   7│
   2   4│omega┃   6   8│omega

═════════════════════════════
*    CONTEXT DIFFERENCES    *
═════════════════════════════
Signs mark lines present in
only one result: - patch1, +
patch2.

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
     new│f.c  ┃     new│f.c
        │@@   ┃        │@@
       1│alpha┃       1│alpha
        │     ┃+      2│rx1
        │     ┃+      3│rx2
        │     ┃+      4│rx3
       2│tx   ┃       5│tx
        │     ┃+      6│extra
       3│     ┃       7│
       4│omega┃        │
